### Base URL variable
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@clusterId = 1


### POST /api/clusters/run — run DBSCAN with default params (CSV data source)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clusters/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eps_meters": 100.0,
  "min_samples": 3,
  "replace_existing": false
}

###

### POST /api/clusters/run — run with date filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clusters/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eps_meters": 150.0,
  "min_samples": 2,
  "date_from": "2025-01-01",
  "date_to": "2025-12-31",
  "replace_existing": true
}

###

### POST /api/clusters/run — replace existing clusters for same params
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clusters/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eps_meters": 100.0,
  "min_samples": 3,
  "replace_existing": true
}

###

### GET /api/clusters — list all clusters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clusters

###

### GET /api/clusters/{id} — get cluster detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clusters/{{clusterId}}

###

### GET /api/clusters/{id}/accidents — list accidents in cluster (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clusters/{{clusterId}}/accidents?page=1&page_size=50
